# Generated data
# - data/raw/ IS committed: pinned API snapshot so the project runs even if the API is down
# - data/processed/ is rebuilt by `python etl.py` in ~1 second
data/processed/*
!data/processed/.gitkeep
data/raw/_extract_manifest.json
*.db
logs/

